meta {
  name: Search
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{base_url}}/api/v1/search?q=hilux brake pads&sort=relevance
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  q: hilux brake pads
  sort: relevance
  ~condition: used
  ~inspected: 1
  ~province_id: 1
  ~radius_km: 25
  ~page: 1
}

docs {
  The same parameters, ranking, tiers and facet counts as the storefront page —
  both go through `SearchRequest` and `ProductSearch`, so any result a buyer
  reached in a browser can be reproduced here.

  Default order is exact-match tier, then partial, and within a tier by quality
  score then **price descending**. Distance is never in the default sort;
  `sort=nearest` with `radius_km` is how a buyer asks for it.
}
